    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d875-a2">

                <pb facs="1011" n="917" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg917"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 945.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Madden.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August 11,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Consular Agent Poche telegraphs that six naturalized American citizens are in
                    prison at Aleppo clamoring for food, which is refused. Inform captain of <hi
                        rendition="#italic">San Francisco</hi> that the seaport for Aleppo is
                    Alexandretta. Inform me immediately when other American war boats reach
                    Smyrna.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
